   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## compose-harmonize.json\n\nCompose + harmonize\n\nE10 - composition: harmonize a scripted paste (see scripts/compose_scene.py). THIS IS THE IDENTITY KNOB: denoise 0.45 integrates lighting + adds a contact shadow while keeping the character; 0.75 REPLACES the subject (fine for scenery, fatal for a character you must keep). Small subjects are the most fragile: at 200 px the same 0.75 nearly erased the knight. Boundary-gradient check: 9.3-9.7 paste -> 7.3-7.6 harmonized.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S6** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E10** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## compose-harmonize.json\n\nCompose + harmonize\n\nE10 - composition: harmonize a scripted paste (see scripts/compose_scene.py). THIS IS THE IDENTITY KNOB: denoise 0.45 integrates lighting + adds a contact shadow while keeping the character; 0.75 REPLACES the subject (fine for scenery, fatal for a character you must keep). Small subjects are the most fragile: at 200 px the same 0.75 nearly erased the knight. Boundary-gradient check: 9.3-9.7 paste -> 7.3-7.6 harmonized.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S6** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E10** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   },
